@startuml
title Hydrographic Network - Simulated Active Pipeline
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180

package "Persisted simulation fields" {
  component "derived/accumulation_flux\nper timestep, per cell" as AccumulationFlux
  component "derived/outflow_drain\nper timestep, per cell" as OutflowDrain
  component "mesh/surface_top\nactive catchment mask" as SurfaceTop
}

package "Computed Run views" {
  component "run.simulated_active_network_mask(...)\nlast / any / persistent / always_active / persistence\nperennial = legacy alias" as ActiveMask
  component "run.simulated_active_network_metrics(...)\noccupancy scalar summary" as ActiveMetrics
  component "run.simulated_active_network_overlap_metrics(...)\ncell overlap, default target = reference" as OverlapMetrics
  component "run.drainage_density()\ntime series" as DrainageDensity
}

package "Current consumers" {
  component "simulated_active_network\ncell-map figure" as ActiveFigure
  component "simulated_active_network_metrics.csv\ncomparison export" as MetricsExport
  component "simulated_active_network_overlap_metrics.csv\nreference overlap export" as OverlapExport
}

package "Persisted vector networks" {
  component "hydrographic_network_reference" as ReferenceNetwork
  component "hydrographic_network_generated" as GeneratedNetwork
}

package "Future canonical role" {
  component "aggregation contract\nthreshold + window + mode" as Contract
  component "permanent/steady-state scenario\npreferred basis for perennial network" as PermanentScenario
  component "optional persisted mask" as PersistedMask
  component "optional vectorization" as Vectorization
  component "hydrographic_network_simulated_active\nGeoDataFrame linework" as SimulatedActiveRole
}

AccumulationFlux --> ActiveMask
SurfaceTop --> ActiveMask
AccumulationFlux --> ActiveMetrics
SurfaceTop --> ActiveMetrics
AccumulationFlux --> DrainageDensity
SurfaceTop --> DrainageDensity
OutflowDrain ..> Contract : possible future source

ActiveMask --> ActiveFigure
ActiveMetrics --> MetricsExport
ActiveMask --> OverlapMetrics
ReferenceNetwork --> OverlapMetrics
GeneratedNetwork --> OverlapMetrics
OverlapMetrics --> OverlapExport

ActiveMask --> Contract : informs
PermanentScenario --> Contract : preferred perennial definition
Contract --> PersistedMask
PersistedMask --> Vectorization
Vectorization --> SimulatedActiveRole

note bottom of ActiveMask
Current implementation is computed on demand.
It does not create a canonical vector role.
end note

note bottom of Contract
This is the main design decision still open:
which threshold, timestep/window and mode should
define one comparable network?
end note

note bottom of PermanentScenario
Use a representative permanent run to define
hydrological perennial behavior. Do not infer it
only from one arbitrary transient chronicle.
end note
@enduml
